{% comment %}
  ============================================
  VAEL CANDLE — Reviews Manager
  ============================================
  
  TO ADD A REVIEW:
  Copy a review block below and fill in the details.
  
  TO DELETE A REVIEW:
  Remove the entire <div class="vael-product-reviews__card"> block.
  
  Then push with:
  shopify theme push --store vael-candle.myshopify.com --theme 196882104668 --allow-live --only snippets/vael-reviews-data.liquid
  
  FIELDS:
  - rating: number 1-5 (used in star-rating)
  - verified: add the <span> line or remove it
  - text: the review content in quotes
  - author: reviewer name
  ============================================
{% endcomment %}

{% comment %} — SUMMARY (edit the numbers here) — {% endcomment %}
{% assign vael_review_avg = "4.9" %}
{% assign vael_review_total = 47 %}

<div class="vael-product-reviews__header">
  <div class="vael-product-reviews__header-left">
    <span class="vael-product-reviews__big-number">{{ vael_review_avg }}</span>
    <div class="vael-product-reviews__header-meta">
      <div class="vael-product-reviews__stars-big">{% render 'star-rating', rating: 5 %}</div>
      <span class="vael-product-reviews__count">Based on {{ vael_review_total }} reviews</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="vael-product-reviews__bars">
    <div class="vael-product-reviews__bar-row"><span class="vael-product-reviews__bar-label">5 ★</span><div class="vael-product-reviews__bar-track"><div class="vael-product-reviews__bar-fill" style="width:82%"></div></div></div>
    <div class="vael-product-reviews__bar-row"><span class="vael-product-reviews__bar-label">4 ★</span><div class="vael-product-reviews__bar-track"><div class="vael-product-reviews__bar-fill" style="width:12%"></div></div></div>
    <div class="vael-product-reviews__bar-row"><span class="vael-product-reviews__bar-label">3 ★</span><div class="vael-product-reviews__bar-track"><div class="vael-product-reviews__bar-fill" style="width:4%"></div></div></div>
    <div class="vael-product-reviews__bar-row"><span class="vael-product-reviews__bar-label">2 ★</span><div class="vael-product-reviews__bar-track"><div class="vael-product-reviews__bar-fill" style="width:1%"></div></div></div>
    <div class="vael-product-reviews__bar-row"><span class="vael-product-reviews__bar-label">1 ★</span><div class="vael-product-reviews__bar-track"><div class="vael-product-reviews__bar-fill" style="width:1%"></div></div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="vael-product-reviews__list">

  {% comment %} ——— REVIEW 1 ——— {% endcomment %}
  <div class="vael-product-reviews__card">
    <div class="vael-product-reviews__card-top">
      <div class="vael-product-reviews__avatar">E</div>
      <div class="vael-product-reviews__card-info">
        <p class="vael-product-reviews__card-author">Emily R.</p>
        <span class="vael-product-reviews__verified">✓ Verified Buyer</span>
      </div>
      <div class="vael-product-reviews__card-stars">{% render 'star-rating', rating: 5 %}</div>
    </div>
    <p class="vael-product-reviews__card-text">"I poured it into an old ceramic bowl and it looked absolutely stunning. So easy to set up — literally took 30 seconds. The flame is calm and clean, no smoke at all."</p>
  </div>

  {% comment %} ——— REVIEW 2 ——— {% endcomment %}
  <div class="vael-product-reviews__card">
    <div class="vael-product-reviews__card-top">
      <div class="vael-product-reviews__avatar">S</div>
      <div class="vael-product-reviews__card-info">
        <p class="vael-product-reviews__card-author">Sarah L.</p>
        <span class="vael-product-reviews__verified">✓ Verified Buyer</span>
      </div>
      <div class="vael-product-reviews__card-stars">{% render 'star-rating', rating: 5 %}</div>
    </div>
    <p class="vael-product-reviews__card-text">"Bought this as a gift for my sister and she was obsessed. The candle sand concept is genius — you can reuse the same bowl forever. Way better than regular candles."</p>
  </div>

  {% comment %} ——— REVIEW 3 ——— {% endcomment %}
  <div class="vael-product-reviews__card">
    <div class="vael-product-reviews__card-top">
      <div class="vael-product-reviews__avatar">T</div>
      <div class="vael-product-reviews__card-info">
        <p class="vael-product-reviews__card-author">Tom K.</p>
        <span class="vael-product-reviews__verified">✓ Verified Buyer</span>
      </div>
      <div class="vael-product-reviews__card-stars">{% render 'star-rating', rating: 5 %}</div>
    </div>
    <p class="vael-product-reviews__card-text">"Used it in a glass jar on my dinner table. Looks designer-level honestly. Burns clean, lasts long, and you can just add more sand when it runs low. Will buy again."</p>
  </div>

  {% comment %} ——— REVIEW 4 ——— {% endcomment %}
  <div class="vael-product-reviews__card">
    <div class="vael-product-reviews__card-top">
      <div class="vael-product-reviews__avatar">J</div>
      <div class="vael-product-reviews__card-info">
        <p class="vael-product-reviews__card-author">Jessica M.</p>
        <span class="vael-product-reviews__verified">✓ Verified Buyer</span>
      </div>
      <div class="vael-product-reviews__card-stars">{% render 'star-rating', rating: 4 %}</div>
    </div>
    <p class="vael-product-reviews__card-text">"Really cool concept. I love that it's eco-friendly and unscented so I can add my own oils. Shipping was fast too. Only wish the bag was a bit bigger!"</p>
  </div>

  {% comment %} ——— REVIEW 5 ——— {% endcomment %}
  <div class="vael-product-reviews__card">
    <div class="vael-product-reviews__card-top">
      <div class="vael-product-reviews__avatar">A</div>
      <div class="vael-product-reviews__card-info">
        <p class="vael-product-reviews__card-author">Anna G.</p>
        <span class="vael-product-reviews__verified">✓ Verified Buyer</span>
      </div>
      <div class="vael-product-reviews__card-stars">{% render 'star-rating', rating: 5 %}</div>
    </div>
    <p class="vael-product-reviews__card-text">"I've reused 4 containers already — old mugs, a vase, a coconut shell. This stuff just works. Clean burn, no mess, and it feels so satisfying to make your own candle."</p>
  </div>

  {% comment %} ——— ADD NEW REVIEWS BELOW ——— {% endcomment %}
  {% comment %}
  TEMPLATE — copy this block and fill in:
  
